\meta{status}{planned}
\tag{milestone}

\p{Complete the repaired root, relative walking structures and \code{Mod}, the matrix/discrete category path, and vertical 2-cell/categorical-core extraction. Prove \ref{at-rt-0001}/2/3/5/6/7/ 10/11/12 in their revised scopes. \ref{at-rt-0004} is retired. Complete the specific closure and invariance theorems of each export. Run both builds, axiom audit, nontrivial client, performance checks, and thin API generation. Discrete \code{paste} is usable.}
\p{\strong{Exit:} the full exported specification has an implementation and passes the swap test. \strong{Freeze:} that root/signature and its proved comparisons. General \code{hP}, arbitrary fixed-target rectification, and unvalidated shapes are absent from the frozen interface.}
